{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"automated","type":"text","text":"AUTOMATED ENUMERATION\nlinpeas, LinEnum veya LSE'den 1-2 tanesini calistir\nCiktiyi tek basina kanit kabul etme\nOncelikle groups, capabilities, SUID ve password uyarilarini oku\nHer bulguyu manuel komutla tekrar dogrula, sonra ilgili karta git","x":-850,"y":-110,"width":620,"height":220},
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"ROOT PROOF / REPORT\nwhoami, id, hostname ve root flag kanitini al\nKullanilan bulgu, komut, path, dosya izni ve exploit gerekcesini kaydet\nShell root olduysa SSH key'leri ve hash'leri loot et\nPersistence sadece istenirse: authorized_keys veya uygun hesap","x":4440,"y":1920,"width":620,"height":230},
		{"id":"container","type":"text","text":"DOCKER / CONTAINER\n/proc/1/cgroup ve /.dockerenv ile container sinyalini kontrol et\nid icinde docker grubu var mi? -> docker run -v /:/mnt ... chroot\ncap_sys_admin ve writable cgroup release_agent var mi?\nHost filesystem mount veya cgroup escape'i sadece dogrulanmis kosullarda uygula","x":6430,"y":4080,"width":650,"height":160},
		{"id":"pathwild","type":"text","text":"PATH HIJACK / WILDCARD\nPATH ve writable directory'leri cikar\nRoot script absolute path kullanmiyorsa once aranan binary adini writable dizine koy\ntar/rsync/chown/chmod * kullaniyorsa checkpoint/action veya uygun wildcard payload'ini dogrula\nTrigger'i bekle, root shell ve kanit al","x":6750,"y":-1060,"width":650,"height":180},
		{"id":"cap","type":"text","text":"CAPABILITIES\ngetcap -r / 2>/dev/null\ncap_setuid+ep: python/perl ile UID 0\ncap_dac_read_search+ep: shadow veya hassas dosyalari oku\ncap_sys_admin+ep: mount/container escape ihtimalini kontrol et\nExploit'i binary ve capability ile manuel dogrula","x":3780,"y":-1420,"width":540,"height":200},
		{"id":"baseline","type":"text","text":"BASELINE ENUMERATION\nwhoami; id; hostname\nuname -a; cat /etc/os-release\nGercek shell kullanicilarini /etc/passwd'den cikar\nss -tulnp veya netstat ile local servisleri bul\nArdindan sudo -l calistir: ilk ve en yuksek getirili kontrol","x":-760,"y":800,"width":480,"height":220},
		{"id":"start","type":"text","text":"INITIAL ACCESS / USER SHELL\nUser shell alindiysa once stabilizasyon yap\nPTY: python3 -c 'import pty; pty.spawn(\"/bin/bash\")'\nTERM=xterm, stty raw -echo; fg, listener ve tool transfer hazirla","x":-1760,"y":390,"width":520,"height":180},
		{"id":"sudo","type":"text","text":"SUDO ABUSE\nvim/less/man/find/python/perl/ruby/awk/tar/systemctl/apt gibi binary'leri GTFOBins ile eslestir\nAllowed custom script'i oku: injection, relative path, writable dependency\nenv_keep icinde LD_PRELOAD veya PYTHONPATH var mi?\nShell/root alinca proof kaydet ve loot loop'a don","x":680,"y":-700,"width":600,"height":230},
		{"id":"creds","type":"text","text":"CREDENTIAL HUNTING\n/etc, /var/www, /opt, /home icinde config, .env, yml, php, json, wp-config ara\n.bash_history, .mysql_history, backup/old/swp ve .git log kontrol et\nSSH key, pem, authorized_keys, SQL/SQLite, /proc/*/cmdline ve environ\nAWS credentials, Docker config ve servis konfigurasyonlarini oku","x":970,"y":2150,"width":590,"height":170},
		{"id":"suid","type":"text","text":"SUID / SGID\nfind / -perm -4000 -type f 2>/dev/null\nStandart binary -> GTFOBins'in SUID sutununu kullan\nCustom/unknown binary -> strings, ltrace, objdump/checksec; relative system call ve buffer overflow ara\nSUID nmap eskiyse interactive mode'u ve binary versiyonunu dogrula","x":2560,"y":-780,"width":620,"height":180},
		{"id":"cron","type":"text","text":"CRON JOBS\n/etc/crontab, /etc/cron.*, spool ve crontab -l oku\npspy ile 60-90 saniye gercek calismayi izle\nRoot script writable mi? -> reverse shell/komut ekle\nRelative path veya zayif PATH mi? -> PATH hijack\nKomutta * var mi? -> wildcard injection dalina git","x":5200,"y":-595,"width":440,"height":195},
		{"id":"internal","type":"text","text":"INTERNAL SERVICE CHECK\nss -tulnp / netstat ile 127.0.0.1 servislerini kontrol et\nWeb app veya DB internal-only ise SSH local forward ya da chisel kullan\nDefault credential, config leak ve servis CVE'si ara\nYeni foothold veya credential varsa loot/privesc dongusune don","x":1560,"y":3565,"width":600,"height":155},
		{"id":"kernel","type":"text","text":"KERNEL / SERVICE EXPLOIT\nTum manuel yollar tukendikten sonra uname -a ve sudo -V ile versiyon kontrol et\nsearchsploit ve linux-exploit-suggester ile adaylari dogrula\nPwnKit, DirtyPipe, DirtyCow, Baron Samedit ve overlayfs kosullarini kontrol et\nSon secenek: noisy olabilir, box'i crash etmeyecek payload sec","x":3780,"y":4640,"width":620,"height":160},
		{"id":"footholdnote","type":"file","file":"Initial Foothold/Linux Foothold.md","x":-2600,"y":-110,"width":560,"height":590},
		{"id":"linuxnote","type":"file","file":"Privilege Escalation/Linux Privilege Escalation.md","x":-1160,"y":-1480,"width":930,"height":1120},
		{"id":"sudodecision","type":"text","text":"sudo -l sonuc verdi mi?\nNOPASSWD veya parola istemeyen bir binary/script var mi?\nEVET -> GTFOBins'te sudo teknigini kontrol et\nOzel script ise input, wildcard, PATH ve writable dosya ara\nHayir -> credential hunting'e gec","x":160,"y":280,"width":520,"height":170},
		{"id":"files","type":"text","text":"WRITABLE SENSITIVE FILES\n/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/sudoers izinlerini kontrol et\nWritable passwd -> UID 0 kullanici ekle\nWritable shadow -> root hash degistir\nWritable sudoers -> NOPASSWD ALL ekle\nWritable config/service dosyalari varsa servisin root context'ini dogrula","x":7240,"y":1000,"width":580,"height":195},
		{"id":"nfs","type":"text","text":"NFS MISCONFIGURATION\nTarget'ta /etc/exports, attacker'da showmount -e kontrol et\nWritable export ve no_root_squash var mi?\nEVET -> rw,vers=3 mount et; bash kopyala ve SUID ayarla\nTarget'ta /share/bash -p ile root shell dene","x":8040,"y":2920,"width":480,"height":160},
		{"id":"credsdecision","type":"text","text":"Credential veya key bulundu mu?\nEVET -> su, ssh, mysql ve diger local servislerde dene\nAyni parola diger local kullanicilarda var mi?\nDB credential ise root DB, LOAD_FILE/UDF gibi yollarla kontrol et\nBasarisizsa SUID kontrolune gec","x":1860,"y":1340,"width":540,"height":170},
		{"id":"transfernote","type":"file","file":"File Transfers/File Transfers.md","x":-2320,"y":1120,"width":760,"height":980}
	],
